    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T10:01:46Z",
    "body": "Test request for the Hurco WinMax post (PR #2646), also asked of vilts on the PR. Could you check three short programs from this PR in the **WinMax simulator** (graphics / simulation only, please do not run them on the machine)? This is the last open item before the Hurco post can merge: the review asks for evidence that WinMax loads and draws these programs correctly.\n\nAll three are metric (G21), work offset G54, and Z0 is the **top of the stock**. Each is plain NC/ISO, so load it as an NC program.\n\n### 1. `FACE1.NC` - facing a 40 x 40 mm square\n- Tool **T1**, 10 mm end mill, `T1 M6` then `G43 H1`, 4500 rpm.\n- Expect: 4 back-and-forth passes at **Z-2**, from X-5 to X45, at Y5, Y13, Y21, Y29 and a last pass at Y35. Then Z up to 5 and a return home (`G91 G28 Z0.` then `G28 X0. Y0.`).\n\n<details><summary>FACE1.NC</summary>\n\n```\n%\nO0001 (VMC 3-AXIS)\nG21\nG90 G17 G94 G54 G40 G49 G80\n(SETUP: Setup1)\n(OPERATION: Face1 - Facing - G54)\n(T1 10MM 3FL END MILL - Flat end mill D10)\nT1 M6\nG43 H1\nG90 G54\nS4500 M3\nM8\nG00 Z5.\nG00 X-5. Y5. Z5.\nG01 X-5. Y5. Z-2. F100\nG01 X45. Y5. Z-2. F500\nG01 X45. Y13. Z-2. F500\nG01 X-5. Y13. Z-2. F500\nG01 X-5. Y21. Z-2. F500\nG01 X45. Y21. Z-2. F500\nG01 X45. Y29. Z-2. F500\nG01 X-5. Y29. Z-2. F500\nG01 X-5. Y35. Z-2. F500\nG01 X45. Y35. Z-2. F500\nG00 X45. Y35. Z5.\nM9\nM5\nG91 G28 Z0.\nG28 X0. Y0.\nG90\nM30\n%\n```\n</details>\n\n### 2. `DRILL1.NC` - one peck-drilled hole\n- Tool **T4**, 6 mm drill, `T4 M6` / `G43 H4`, 1500 rpm.\n- Expect: one hole at **X20 Y10**, **G73** peck cycle to **Z-24**, peck depth Q18, R plane Z0, feed 60. Then `G80`, retract, home.\n\n<details><summary>DRILL1.NC</summary>\n\n```\n%\nO0001 (VMC 3-AXIS)\nG21\nG90 G17 G94 G54 G40 G49 G80\n(SETUP: Setup1)\n(OPERATION: Drill1 - Drill - G54)\n(T4 6MM HSS DRILL - Drill D6)\nT4 M6\nG43 H4\nG90 G54\nS1500 M3\nM8\nG00 Z6.\nG00 X20. Y10.\nG00 X20. Y10. Z0.\nG99 G73 X20. Y10. Z-24. Q18. R0. F60\nG80\nG00 X20. Y10. Z6.\nM9\nM5\nG91 G28 Z0.\nG28 X0. Y0.\nG90\nM30\n%\n```\n</details>\n\n### 3. `CONTOUR1.NC` - outside profile of a 40 x 20 plate plus a small pocket\n- Tool **T2**, 6 mm end mill, `T2 M6` / `G43 H2`, 6000 rpm.\n- Expect: the tool centre traces a **rounded rectangle** X-3..X43, Y-3..Y23 with R3 corners (the outside of a 40 x 20 part with sharp corners), entering and leaving on short arcs near X43 Y-6. Then a small square path around **X20 Y10**. Both are cut twice: first at **Z-2**, then at **Z-4**.\n- The arcs (G02/G03 with I/J) are the main thing to check: they should be smooth corners in the right direction, not full circles or bulges.\n\n<details><summary>CONTOUR1.NC</summary>\n\n```\n%\nO0001 (VMC 3-AXIS)\nG21\nG90 G17 G94 G54 G40 G49 G80\n(SETUP: Setup1)\n(OPERATION: Contour1 - 2D Contour - G54)\n(T2 6MM 3FL END MILL - Flat end mill D6)\nT2 M6\nG43 H2\nG90 G54\nS6000 M3\nM8\nG00 Z5.\nG00 X43.514 Y-5.802 Z5.\nG00 X43.514 Y-5.802 Z2.\nG01 X43.514 Y-5.802 Z-2. F100\nG03 X40.346 Y-2.98 I-2.995 J-0.173 F500\nG01 X40. Y-3. Z-2. F500\nG01 X0. Y-3. Z-2. F500\nG02 X-3. Y0. I0. J3. F500\nG01 X-3. Y20. Z-2. F500\nG02 X0. Y23. I3. J0. F500\nG01 X40. Y23. Z-2. F500\nG02 X43. Y20. I0. J-3. F500\nG01 X43. Y0. Z-2. F500\nG02 X40.346 Y-2.98 I-3. J0. F500\nG03 X37.711 Y-6.306 I0.345 J-2.98 F500\nG01 X37.711 Y-6.306 Z2. F500\nG00 X19.25 Y9.75 Z2.\nG01 X19.25 Y9.75 Z-2. F100\nG03 X20. Y9. I0.75 J0. F500\nG01 X21. Y9. Z-2. F500\nG01 X21. Y11. Z-2. F500\nG01 X19. Y11. Z-2. F500\nG01 X19. Y9. Z-2. F500\nG01 X20. Y9. Z-2. F500\nG03 X20.75 Y9.75 I0. J0.75 F500\nG00 X20.75 Y9.75 Z5.\nG00 X43.514 Y-5.802 Z5.\nG00 X43.514 Y-5.802 Z2.\nG01 X43.514 Y-5.802 Z-4. F100\nG03 X40.346 Y-2.98 I-2.995 J-0.173 F500\nG01 X40. Y-3. Z-4. F500\nG01 X0. Y-3. Z-4. F500\nG02 X-3. Y0. I0. J3. F500\nG01 X-3. Y20. Z-4. F500\nG02 X0. Y23. I3. J0. F500\nG01 X40. Y23. Z-4. F500\nG02 X43. Y20. I0. J-3. F500\nG01 X43. Y0. Z-4. F500\nG02 X40.346 Y-2.98 I-3. J0. F500\nG03 X37.711 Y-6.306 I0.345 J-2.98 F500\nG01 X37.711 Y-6.306 Z2. F500\nG00 X19.25 Y9.75 Z2.\nG01 X19.25 Y9.75 Z-4. F100\nG03 X20. Y9. I0.75 J0. F500\nG01 X21. Y9. Z-4. F500\nG01 X21. Y11. Z-4. F500\nG01 X19. Y11. Z-4. F500\nG01 X19. Y9. Z-4. F500\nG01 X20. Y9. Z-4. F500\nG03 X20.75 Y9.75 I0. J0.75 F500\nG00 X20.75 Y9.75 Z5.\nM9\nM5\nG91 G28 Z0.\nG28 X0. Y0.\nG90\nM30\n%\n```\n</details>\n\n### What would help most\nFor each program:\n1. Did WinMax load it without an alarm or warning? If not, the exact message and the line it points at.\n2. A screenshot of the simulated toolpath.\n3. Anything that looks different from the \"Expect\" lines above (an arc going the wrong way, a move to an odd place, a tool change or G43/G28 handled differently).\n\nThank you - this is what lets us ship the post with confidence.\n",
