    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T11:17:02Z",
    "body": "@vilts - thank you. Here are the tool numbers for the three test programs. The post writes the tool number as the `T` word and as the `H` word of `G43`. Only these lines change. All other lines stay the same.\n\n`FACE1.NC` (10 mm end mill, T109):\n\n```\n(T109 10MM 3FL END MILL - Flat end mill D10)\nT109 M6\nG43 H109\n```\n\n`DRILL1.NC` (6 mm drill, T562):\n\n```\n(T562 6MM HSS DRILL - Drill D6)\nT562 M6\nG43 H562\n```\n\n`CONTOUR1.NC` (6 mm end mill, T106):\n\n```\n(T106 6MM 3FL END MILL - Flat end mill D6)\nT106 M6\nG43 H106\n```\n\nIf WinMax uses a different `H` number for these tools, please tell us. We also need, for each program, the load result and a screenshot of the simulated path.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
